wave-overhangs: wire the generator into the slicing pipeline + config

Additive hooks into existing libslic3r files: the ~40 wave_overhang_* PrintConfig
options, the PerimeterGenerator/PrintObject invocation, GCode/CoolingBuffer
overrides, the Preset print_options registration, and the ExtrusionPath path-tag
fields. Includes the 2D->3D Polyline3 adaptation and the wall_filament->
outer_wall_filament_id / role_speed re-anchoring for the 6bb7903b pin. Re-validate
on every OrcaSlicer submodule bump.

